---
---
<section id="rd-wing" class="py-24 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16">
            <div class="lg:w-1/2">
                <span class="text-accent font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">Innovation Lab</span>
                <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-3 mb-8 tracking-tight">Research & Development (R&D) Wing</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                    At Globix Tech, we believe the future is built on rigorous research. Our R&D center is dedicated to exploring emerging technologies that solve real-world industrial challenges.
                </p>
                <div class="space-y-6 mb-10">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-accent flex-shrink-0">
                            <i class="fas fa-flask text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-xl mb-1 mt-1">Emerging Tech Research</h4>
                            <p class="text-slate-500">Continual focus on blockchain, advanced AI architectures, and quantum-safe cryptography.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-accent flex-shrink-0">
                            <i class="fas fa-file-invoice text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-xl mb-1 mt-1">Academic Publishing</h4>
                            <p class="text-slate-500">We assist researchers and professionals in drafting, validating, and publishing technical papers in high-impact international journals.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-accent flex-shrink-0">
                            <i class="fas fa-university text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-xl mb-1 mt-1">Journal Collaboration</h4>
                            <p class="text-slate-500">Strong network with international technical journals to ensure academic excellence and peer-reviewed validation.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-dark p-6 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-between text-white border-l-4 border-accent shadow-xl">
                    <div>
                        <h5 class="font-bold">Latest Research Paper</h5>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Published in Global IT Tech Journal, 2025</p>
                    </div>
                    <a href="#" class="text-accent font-bold hover:underline">Read Now <i class="fas fa-external-link-alt ml-1 text-[10px]"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="lg:w-1/2 w-full">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-lg transform translate-y-8 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 border border-slate-100">
                        <i class="fas fa-book-reader text-4xl text-accent mb-6"></i>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Paper Drafting</h4>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Professional structuring of research ideas into academic format.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 border border-slate-100">
                        <i class="fas fa-vial text-4xl text-primary mb-6"></i>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Tech Validation</h4>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Simulation and testing of proposed technical models.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-lg transform translate-y-8 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 border border-slate-100">
                        <i class="fas fa-search-plus text-4xl text-secondary mb-6"></i>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Data Analysis</h4>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Using Data Science to validate hypotheses with real metrics.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 border border-slate-100">
                        <i class="fas fa-globe text-4xl text-green-500 mb-6"></i>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Global Impact</h4>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Bridging the gap between theory and industrial reality.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
